{
  "description": "Cases that `premier diff` (crates/premier-cli/src/evidence.rs) and the viewer comparison (apps/viewer/src/lib/semanticCompare.ts) must both reproduce. An event lists only the fields a case cares about; both test suites fill the rest with the same defaults: event_id \"<side>-<sequence>\", trace_id \"<side>\", timestamp \"2026-07-15T12:00:00Z\", source \"sdk\", actor_id \"agent\", actor_type \"agent\", status \"ok\", duration_ms 0, payload {}, and empty parent_event_id, span_id, parent_span_id, correlation_id and links. `fields` are the names of an item's changes, in order.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "the same command recorded twice: collector port and output chunking differ",
      "baseline": [
        {
          "sequence": 1,
          "kind": "session.start",
          "actor_id": "root",
          "source": "premier",
          "payload": {
            "command": [
              "sh",
              "-c",
              "printf"
            ],
            "instrumentation": "http://127.0.0.1:50001/v1/events",
            "capture_mode": "pipes"
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": 2,
          "kind": "process.stdout",
          "actor_id": "root",
          "source": "command",
          "status": "running",
          "payload": {
            "byte_length": 6,
            "stream": "stdout",
            "text": "one\ntw"
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": 3,
          "kind": "process.stdout",
          "actor_id": "root",
          "source": "command",
          "status": "running",
          "payload": {
            "byte_length": 8,
            "stream": "stdout",
            "text": "o\nthree\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "sequence": 4,
          "kind": "process.exit",
          "actor_id": "root",
          "source": "command",
          "payload": {
            "exit_code": 0,
            "success": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "current": [
        {
          "sequence": 1,
          "kind": "session.start",
          "actor_id": "root",
          "source": "premier",
          "payload": {
            "command": [
